    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "Every doc carries four context fields beyond the title: a description, a target audience, a language, and the template it was created from. The AI sees them on every prompt, so a one-time minute setting them up saves you re-typing context on every \"rewrite this\" / \"extend this\" / \"draft a section\".",
